{"slug":"b-ss-r","ar":"ب ص ر","total":148,"core":"sight; insight","forms":[{"ar":"بَصِير","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":51,"gloss":"The All-Seeing","word":"al-baseer","ex":{"s":20,"a":35,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّكَ","كُنتَ","بِنَا","بَصِيرًا"],"en":"Indeed, You are of us ever Seeing"}},{"ar":"بَصَر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":48,"gloss":"sight, eyes","word":null,"ex":{"s":79,"a":9,"p":1,"ar":["أَبْصَـٰرُهَا","خَـٰشِعَةٌ"],"en":"Their eyes humbled"}},{"ar":"أَبْصَرَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":29,"gloss":"to see","word":null,"ex":{"s":68,"a":5,"p":1,"ar":["فَسَتُبْصِرُ","وَيُبْصِرُونَ"],"en":"So you will see and they will see"}},{"ar":"بَصِيرَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"insight; evidence","word":null,"ex":{"s":75,"a":14,"p":5,"ar":["بَلِ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","عَلَىٰ","نَفْسِهِۦ","بَصِيرَةٌ"],"en":"Rather, man, against himself, will be a witness"}},{"ar":"مُبْصِر","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"seeing; giving light","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":201,"p":12,"ar":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","إِذَا","مَسَّهُمْ","طَـٰٓئِفٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","تَذَكَّرُوا۟","فَإِذَا","هُم","مُّبْصِرُونَ"],"en":"Indeed, those who fear Allah - when an impulse touches them from Satan, they remember [Him] and at once they have insight"}},{"ar":"بَصُرَتْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":3,"gloss":"to perceive, watch","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":11,"p":4,"ar":["وَقَالَتْ","لِأُخْتِهِۦ","قُصِّيهِ ۖ","فَبَصُرَتْ","بِهِۦ","عَن","جُنُبٍ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يَشْعُرُونَ"],"en":"And she said to his sister, \"Follow him\"; so she watched him from a distance while they perceived not"}},{"ar":"مُبْصِرَة","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"visible, giving sight","word":null,"ex":{"s":27,"a":13,"p":4,"ar":["فَلَمَّا","جَآءَتْهُمْ","ءَايَـٰتُنَا","مُبْصِرَةً","قَالُوا۟","هَـٰذَا","سِحْرٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"en":"But when there came to them Our visible signs, they said, \"This is obvious magic"}},{"ar":"مُسْتَبْصِرِين","kind":"active participle","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"insightful","word":null,"ex":{"s":29,"a":38,"p":16,"ar":["وَعَادًا","وَثَمُودَا۟","وَقَد","تَّبَيَّنَ","لَكُم","مِّن","مَّسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۖ","وَزَيَّنَ","لَهُمُ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","فَصَدَّهُمْ","عَنِ","ٱلسَّبِيلِ","وَكَانُوا۟","مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ"],"en":"And [We destroyed] 'Aad and Thamud, and it has become clear to you from their [ruined] dwellings. And Satan had made pleasing to them their deeds and averted them from the path, and they were endowed with perception"}},{"ar":"تَبْصِرَة","kind":"verbal noun","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"insight, enlightenment","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":8,"p":1,"ar":["تَبْصِرَةً","وَذِكْرَىٰ","لِكُلِّ","عَبْدٍ","مُّنِيبٍ"],"en":"Giving insight and a reminder for every servant who turns [to Allah]"}},{"ar":"يُبَصَّرُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"to be shown","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":11,"p":1,"ar":["يُبَصَّرُونَهُمْ ۚ","يَوَدُّ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُ","لَوْ","يَفْتَدِى","مِنْ","عَذَابِ","يَوْمِئِذٍۭ","بِبَنِيهِ"],"en":"They will be shown each other. The criminal will wish that he could be ransomed from the punishment of that Day by his children"}}],"surahs":[[2,9],[17,8],[6,7],[7,6],[3,5],[24,5],[40,5],[67,5],[20,4],[37,4],[68,4],[10,3],[11,3],[12,3],[16,3],[22,3],[27,3],[28,3],[32,3],[35,3],[41,3],[4,2],[8,2],[19,2],[21,2],[33,2],[36,2],[38,2],[42,2],[45,2],[46,2],[50,2],[54,2],[69,2],[70,2],[75,2],[5,1],[13,1],[14,1],[15,1],[18,1],[23,1],[25,1],[29,1],[31,1],[34,1],[43,1],[47,1],[48,1],[49,1],[51,1],[52,1],[53,1],[56,1],[57,1],[58,1],[59,1],[60,1],[64,1],[76,1],[79,1],[84,1]]}